{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>MyDeadline+ 是一款結合日曆、任務與長期規劃的時間管理 App，適合需要同時掌握課程、工作與生活安排的使用者。它把每日任務、截止期限、月度與年度計劃集中呈現，讓即將到來的事項和長遠目標一目瞭然。現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，原價 US $2.99。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-250.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>集中管理任務與長期規劃</h2>\n<p>在日曆中查看任務與截止期限，滑動即可建立單日事項或多日任務，並管理月度與年度計劃。你可自訂群組、類別與顏色，過往事項會自動封存，讓目前行程保持清晰；iCloud 會在 iPhone 與 iPad 之間同步資料，Apple Watch 也可查看及作基本編輯。寬螢幕裝置可並排顯示月份與年份，另設可選 AI 語音編輯、每日通知與項目提醒。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-243-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-244-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-245-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-246-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-247-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：MyDeadline+</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/mydeadline/id6804910551?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T01:38:29.554482+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":354,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T01:25:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T02:57:36.380417+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T01:31:52.504480+00:00","content_hash":"b42673269b91f87cfd5cdafc8c41ec6d4bb924b827f0d8fbdd7838f52d86d4ce","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}